  {title:'See the containment',narration:'Switch to the overlaid view: the small triangle sits inside the sector, and the sector sits inside the big triangle. Because area respects containment, sin x / 2 ≤ x / 2 ≤ tan x / 2 follows immediately.',state:{viewMode:'overlay',highlight:'none',angleX:0.9}},
  {title:'Read the upper bound',narration:'Highlight the outer triangle to surface its area tan x / 2 — this is the largest of the three and gives the upper bound on the sector\'s area x / 2.',state:{viewMode:'overlay',highlight:'outerTriangle',angleX:0.9}},
